\label{sec:isocompute}

At $2.71\times$ KL compute budget (2700 steps, matched wall-clock), BCE achieves PPL 28.13$\pm$0.20 (3-seed), still $2.39\times$ worse than KL (11.79). % exp_id: bce50_3seed

